 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Thomas spoke up in the room of light",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord we do not know where you go",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "How can we find the road tonight",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the path is hidden and low",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You know the place you will prepare",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A room for us to finally stay",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But how can we find you there",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If we do not know the way",
